		Microchip PIC64GX - Board Support Package


Table of Contents
=================
1. Supported Boards
2. Change History
3. BSP Features
4. BSP Notes


1. Supported Boards
===================

This BSP supports the following boards:

  + Microchip PIC64GX Curiosity Kit - PIC64GX1000-V/FCS - RISC-V. REV 2.0


2. Change History
=================

  - 2026/10 : Wind River Linux 10.26. Support PIC64GX Curiosity Kit board for both
			  standard and preempt-rt kernel based on Microchip PIC64GX linux-6.18-mchp 2026.04.


3. BSP Features
===============

3.1 Supported Features
----------------------
The following BSP features are validated and supported on boards where
the corresponding h/w features exist.

  o General Platform
	+ DMA engine

  o Bus
	+ 3 x UART (via single micro USB)
	+ 2 x I2C
	+ 2 x SPI
	+ PCIe 2.0 x1

  o Network
	+ 1 x Gigabit Ethernet: Cadence MACB/GEM ethernet interface

  o Memory & Storage
	+ DDR: 1 GB DDR4 x 16
	+ SD card slot

  o Misc Devices
	+ DMA: SiFive platform DMA (PDMA) engine
	+ RTC: built-in RTC
	+ Watchdog

3.2 Unsupported Features
------------------------

The following features are not supported and not validated.

	x Micro USB 2.0 OTG
	x MikroBUS
	x HDMI
	x User IO Connector


4. BSP Notes
============

4.1 CURIOSITY-PIC64GX1000-KIT
-----------------------------

4.1.1 Validated Board Info
--------------------------
This BSP is only validated in following environment. If you use this BSP
in a different environment it may possibly have some issues.

	Processor:		PIC64GX1000-V/FCS
	Board:			PIC64GX Curiosity Kit
	BootLoader:		U-Boot
	BootLoader Version:	2025.07-linux4microchip-2026.04 (Apr 29 2026 - 08:52:30 +0000)

Here is the board link:
  https://www.microchip.com/en-us/development-tool/curiosity-pic64gx1000-kit

